            <ArticleTitle>Palladium-Catalyzed Sequential Vinylic C-H Arylation/Amination of 2-Vinylanilines with Aryl boronic Acids: Access to 2-Arylindoles.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>323-329</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.joc.7b02728</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A palladium-catalyzed selective and successive vinylic C-H arylation/amination of 2-vinylanilines with arylboronic acids to generate indoles has been developed. This procedure represents a straightforward and practical approach to valuable multifunctionalized indoles.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
